  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "2b17c993-1749-47d6-82c1-1779994e6c35",
      "title": "No provador com duas opções",
      "description": "<p>A cliente já provou uma chaqueta e ainda vai experimentar outra talla antes de decidir.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">¿Qué tal te queda la chaqueta gris?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Como a jaqueta cinza fica em você?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/2db645db0d364bc2a66f9e034254b8e5_l03b01-01-que-tal-te-queda-la-chaqueta-gris.mp3?Expires=1794099651&Signature=aqKG1SMyY8WxWHzujAUYPUuUfllgc~e7yIK~GBXtWyxilJHXrpixjH8Y1ZUqQxn4X-gnwhcrd9PR1smB2GBwJg1p2U2~mJY3msgXE8HkjdQf7Nl6IrzanPhyxWIVFGbfyusluoVjaesXKJSY~JjjVnp4MvzlrBVNfv8jSrEYm9dLUBK8ahi2ImCfAvKst7y~MY1p67X-wJITWQKKteFxM~qMF3qHVbPlSjYyal2YWYny62kuEW5Wd6-NPuoioXDD9d8kwMdU29Zm0LVGpGGmLv6miELhNiitlNlNPHIZa61rii62qmPw5pBGLSWkSGX04ErwYnqFdAMrZyh3zg~GnQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Me queda bien, pero la azul me sienta mejor.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Ela fica bem em mim, mas a azul me cai melhor.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/bcf031a278044d2bac9dbe0cf7498254_l03b01-02-me-queda-bien-pero-la-azul-me-sienta-mejor.mp3?Expires=1794099651&Signature=quRDfJinB7HFHinhvIc~gmH8QRZcL2BR1VGEYoVClcy2QtbArh6QRMmmMSzZ~vI-G5fhCdom8yZl01J1JLpu2tCoA3I29NRtbgRiIdVn3qgECSahll2SSPPdk3TSWtlOBt1aVljv337vnFvsEQ1VEBT2a4uslUvRkJrXHL2nkr0lmT2vsBg5CpkkbbGqiq82st8MkLbGft3Nbg65pjwtlKvdundNjMIl0CCTe3AlTaeLAxClweA4DhUirM7clgmUC~CHKPwFQQ0xQR3uAphV1mGKN-jMrxpD9l6KrB~j8BHHsXe~hOyeJtH7XhF09~SIyGe~r7kpmXnvnhNA59~D7w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Mientras te pruebas la talla pequeña, te busco el pantalón.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Enquanto você prova o tamanho pequeno, eu busco a calça.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/fdf7ca3c12804defa5789cc6bf583060_l03b01-03-mientras-te-pruebas-la-talla-pequena-te-busco-el-pantalon.mp3?Expires=1794099651&Signature=c5LNmisVwnlCDkHj-H4RGIC6n2C5pOaevtjWw3QBEdlJdqgNVIlRxf4Yv0YHDFrZw4UO4SbjvevvlqQiTU6lmnG~BBZOfV2tMpp-H-ufrNfmU-QYlNss4DiCtamWBMMXIRRyWz94moxUhwF1IqhytJPbgULLvNPtmAKJ83O4vmD1Et-fUODTuuWgDBKue6NMz6ICIzHK2jHpks8K9xPi5nNoN6wHXeTmbAbdk97oqKQTIETXhK3pLyHmnS8HNUL6BKCHk8W1HEKzHxJRBIttkASXWI2QYw5sXXAJFR2VoA7LxN8B0OGkxJSsC87SgxpNHtpJR-woa5--2rPGlzK3pQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Perfecto. En cuanto salga, te digo cuál prefiero.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Perfeito. Assim que eu sair, digo qual prefiro.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/9216ba9dfbb841359a5a1159e4ebb841_l03b01-04-en-cuanto-salga-te-digo-cual-prefiero.mp3?Expires=1794099651&Signature=Qrxg13KuLxgdIWeOrbM5FwA-YJosuKVjJ2MMvLU3fysicOtQilA-AEna8ivf44flkF6UaSMFniB0YkJJwi-hfyqkNpj6fHIHKXl9D5SplUSwEC8WuxkK-yhKxTk2Gh0qinZbY7vddXX82ShrgJ1HkWxiT56mbkK1SNUFu85y8pT5xAMS69PuabCRRNeu6kCzIV61cMM4IvnV543qHOhHTjUtqxagtptqjWR5c3kv3VvRlHYwB7H~3OFRuIU3UCZFHDn~DaetYLM2WX4RHnxaNsYaWE0csApO5iRzbwuV8yKyWNHHHQjzMp4-ANxbz3a-hAe1kUNga4q~i1-Nobnq5w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        }
      ],
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "706e3ade-6aa8-429c-908c-35ba4796fa1c",
      "title": "Passe pelos cartões e observe se a fala resolve ajuste ou escolhe entre duas opcoes.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "b8f98157-98c2-4121-b009-3dd972266ddb",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>me queda bien</strong> resolve primeiro se a peça serve e cai bem no seu corpo.</p><p><strong>La chaqueta gris me queda bien.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>A jaqueta cinza fica bem em mim.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        },
        {
          "id": "884c5a2b-a133-4684-a184-d8268b8e83cc",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>me sienta mejor</strong> aparece quando voce olha para duas opcoes e uma delas favorece mais.</p><p><strong>La azul me sienta mejor.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>A azul me cai melhor.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c2486f76-d473-46ca-95c2-85dd34371420",
          "textContent": "<p>Compare as duas funções:</p><ul><li><strong>me queda bien</strong> = ajuste e conforto imediato</li><li><strong>me sienta mejor</strong> = impressão geral ao comparar</li></ul><p>Por isso a cliente pode dizer: <strong>Me queda bien, pero la azul me sienta mejor.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/5451dd18aa19444fb1c70af33b30815a_l03b01-02-me-queda-bien-pero-la-azul-me-sienta-mejor.mp3?Expires=1794099651&Signature=yudnG5G9Jks2LcqPJPOWvqTeTm6AJdZEEeqUPY8DCK1eJ5D2Dw6Su-nAvci3YJYvlaLa8N-CN3F1fchkNoBQC59T5u6QoHAn~ydL97ZW7cIx9rwUigxt5~phnL9rcSvFkKOrYZq5eiQVXS3f2iA3w9EVeB3wLdL4hIHovhie6ZVdvLTTXjWThccIN~n8L-eI6LfP-xpKSu9Qblz6nEXuEp4DJRpMMhCG7KISWXbQTmNoyHdYDKWcrasYE~f0ZgE9ib-JlQ4Qjaoyu4cK7SDWd5agx5SyXd~BZ3I10wjjdbnghuagYsGD0soDG8nc-XNRUhbn~P5XkBi5eEAUmVp8og__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27f5bb23-dc69-4b1a-ba50-5706233b3b42",
      "title": "Veja as tres frases com audio e compare o grau de reserva em cada uma.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "00c229ae-3042-48e9-bced-25bfaaa6b8b6",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Me parece que la falda negra combina mejor con la chaqueta.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>Acho que a saia preta combina melhor com a jaqueta.</strong></p><p><strong>me parece que</strong> abre uma opiniao cuidadosa sem soar brusca.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/fc0c52ae60844e15824168bc212c5683_l03b03-01-me-parece-que-la-falda-negra-combina-mejor-con-la-chaqueta.mp3?Expires=1794099651&Signature=BsJml9y6Cc8-YrkPl~qDu4exnD90iZLVhQzk4vzfJmKjDbEbFakS8Oy~zgKpqMNoWr~wlhmFSFzt5Af5IPrvgfChihoewE3jiW-lg3~6D9Oz0oYym1~cXpe3Oy9XftP4yP6FHYkyAJe0KUHTxlihMVkMNLB1n0UiArY3DrMU69LA1fchca1Lw~t4zzjWirS4XT0WuQ~CNeywONTDHsVeg-AInM2wECjc0feCfifjlr1h-9wWOr5Ibhq6yzu~IBOwFqmnnEkosGYcyXBjEPpjlWkWXyKtTkizAADpOIhOaTbvsVTXoLanKPx7-5RcZETu3Q6feNad6E7hNUi2W8Gmdw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "d4cd134e-8044-4876-83e1-502302118c31",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>No creo que esta talla me deje moverme bien.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>Não acho que este tamanho me deixe me mover bem.</strong></p><p><strong>no creo que</strong> afasta uma opcao sem fechar a conversa de forma seca.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/219c1771405c4cc7a77a734be8fbf2be_l03b03-02-no-creo-que-esta-talla-me-deje-moverme-bien.mp3?Expires=1794099651&Signature=Yn9tX99LGxK4fwUBIROmNWadcmVT7sNiG8bbfnzA98Q9jeyMnRBRHbniz9dkwkrMESyat-GSFg4cG~DfQvDx8Uep5cYEfe4iRYPDIftZwlfx2j2gMSZ02kgVPqsCGVMSqd32jbHPCUErJBClRbZn868J~D7ezjy1F29TzQbK9mdAxmGhpQkDyHjB3EG4mfp5G5tWnEh-WDkJjwLhBnCdUIdsT24IRXqnMx2Ybz0hsOZlfaXN2TGyPEFgCHSRTGbDfrAfDpHIdNMSeDrO7rDcAcgLGePIwbtmWTrAUbjC4AR8w~v6UzFeRYkG~n0RaCcnC3iWAPgikzwXNKqWuoD-XQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "bdd33ede-dd95-4d29-9619-195d7c97944d",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Dudo que el verde me favorezca tanto como el azul.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>Duvido que o verde me favoreça tanto quanto o azul.</strong></p><p><strong>dudo que</strong> soa mais cético e transforma a reserva em duvida mais forte.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/8d53e9649bae4d97978e4fb61ee4bf28_l03b03-03-dudo-que-el-verde-me-favorezca-tanto-como-el-azul.mp3?Expires=1794099651&Signature=X8MbN~cwPzZp49RSqZFNi80ECp5EFD5eTPgSLGmJrpMbEsfGLthhbu60I4nbvq1UyFbImpUZf7Dv7x96quFwSHd31ECa3ffgb8tsv36M046HWStra3u1K~OvoHskIBAQbNeBk1ox5GFgfy6Hc2VCCA9x9smxID3f5zY7tFpGjOEOW-vdy~cIJ4j~PXK1zpKrVUPUXZAvutCZWWEpT3TJKRmaRV2DEJkBGTcbfQCzl4kohtBG697Aahv96bANyuMJAHOCQF2j8bZUda62LZNEfrhlKRQOrvcPc5-6LlEnWepKQps~VtFfM2vUIxow3snfxn3boR543t7txjz51xNs7w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "9a1e4af8-01f8-4d67-b58d-f095ed5ee0b2",
          "textContent": "<p>As tres aberturas ajudam a graduar a avaliacao:</p><ul><li><strong>me parece que</strong> = opiniao cuidadosa</li><li><strong>no creo que</strong> = pouca confiança nessa opcao</li><li><strong>dudo que</strong> = duvida mais forte</li></ul><p>Depois de <strong>no creo que</strong> e <strong>dudo que</strong>, aparecem formas como <strong>deje</strong> e <strong>favorezca</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a486d806-cf24-4af9-be40-e9dd0181e5e3",
      "title": "Leia os dois marcadores e observe como eles encadeiam o provador sem alongar a fala.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "5fae1391-6531-4f35-b8db-33e591e82607",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Mientras te pruebas la talla pequeña, te busco el pantalón.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>Enquanto você prova o tamanho pequeno, eu busco a calca.</strong></p><p><strong>mientras</strong> mostra duas ações correndo no mesmo momento.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/1d2a911542e4474381df5a4aacae7289_l03b01-03-mientras-te-pruebas-la-talla-pequena-te-busco-el-pantalon.mp3?Expires=1794099651&Signature=Zi-7pfxtt53ZY1U7wBN-ENlnQqgQvSZpTcSNRD1ZLHgI7UKu2AlKHHwh9~OX0LAotcwHyuqWmCnCfPyJkakIq7kzBUlbPy0OHZv0IlkerIbEMFK3~xacfVF67UMm4wL7P4sysqLDjNHVQLtB5Y1NX9WCWcS9cun5JxycKlAgMtdAZCMZdZLx2dKkjJYo3q2RdjYkmn05OKv4OZ42zjXCGSLerm5~pXrL~P1BRQgh0xxrn5fCoe4KAqId0EUEXtGrVuBtJVu2O8TcIPat~9kWKvdpYlzzz1xyn29ROxkv7gIEPqMMWENWubTmyxz4DwDoQ~rmi2L7j7wLpNMikIOVAg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "41208270-b79f-41a5-ba91-81147f3e0389",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>En cuanto salga, te digo cuál prefiero.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>Assim que eu sair, digo qual prefiro.</strong></p><p><strong>en cuanto</strong> empurra a decisão para logo depois da prova.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/997c79c41d5441e584fe19b94cfb2905_l03b01-04-en-cuanto-salga-te-digo-cual-prefiero.mp3?Expires=1794099651&Signature=jjD0tc2ZeabG1tpI2q6fBeH5E33L-AfhlYaHChWCYmFSIDpn5IG7TYkSD2I2judSY5-73lJNeC3sXGZq8CZFAop5HvsfMaY-XIfUHfF1ouS1b6Pyw9QllA7CIc1unQdV6AHlUUb2nll7GTFEtws5xpGq4ERoSzhEuub158anqc0Ksgi-vh0t0MSb3F3lgm3mtmjNnvEeXsdsWBtmIQEQngQKtr6scyCOUg5wcXYeJnhMBFMxh622l3Y0d5GsKKhVd~RXTUI8bonmg-DZtQ0AyTlA91ohHx0wwz5Czec6B0Mia51xGzdkMGFWHskxuTMBj9~JolSm2hKftV1sVw-Row__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "0bcd124e-4091-417e-97aa-43e8c68b0581",
          "textContent": "<p>No provador, os dois marcadores fazem trabalhos diferentes:</p><ul><li><strong>mientras</strong> = algo acontece ao mesmo tempo</li><li><strong>en cuanto</strong> = o passo seguinte vem assim que a prova termina</li></ul><p>Assim, a sequência fica curta e clara sem precisar explicar tudo de novo.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2ce16595-d2a1-4531-aae6-09dbf6e5fedd",
      "title": "Antes de decidir o que levar",
      "description": "<p>Agora a cliente já compara duas peças e ainda deixa a decisão suspensa até ver outra talla.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">¿Te llevas la falda negra o prefieres el vestido azul?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Você vai levar a saia preta ou prefere o vestido azul?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/1b3c59fa2884424a9a3170f6077d90de_l03b05-01-te-llevas-la-falda-negra-o-prefieres-el-vestido-azul.mp3?Expires=1794099651&Signature=LAquybgTYVFhybAl8RSh5rXBiZ04cDVk2Se4X0fa4aQmQXm2lonp0kzlX6HtjBW6XsOZiiVHXkR7-RW~ULp2ytkC2w0yVY1wwGEMvV7Pk8h48AClm8QrJmbr5FQ8y0ghKZnlt4uQCsLuaCoTAIlfSZYzul0S~7P1ZgOWezZ-ILnibUNcgROiij27KOv4YICuQLAvlR93KJmSWGhnKW4BPuKFJtt8Vu518H569~QK7Skg4baVgdWSTUIJvEl72nd5saZs9HU~fSRnlvjAqK3kj5ChwTnAx6kPbOogXJ5zkEezoEffPXch0MQa35Wb-IEbQElzTK7fHgPBsQKyYTSmTQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Me parece que la falda negra combina mejor con la chaqueta.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Acho que a saia preta combina melhor com a jaqueta.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/8a546d78611249878c80969c9719f16a_l03b03-01-me-parece-que-la-falda-negra-combina-mejor-con-la-chaqueta.mp3?Expires=1794099651&Signature=IyQSw5a3YW7t1fZZHUFGj89Bg4l8H47NzSJTJ95GAsG~8cMMtdfeMsZh1w2~hIexs5H4FLbYTWstsxkDeWbXQrGCGfYzgOQ-tqjzyqFhIKrqco0BCZHyDPHXbnt0bFvJqmPCE03yWHgtAAuD5e8ujWFJ0uNdjtRCrWzkrDXrnB1xlpT2HvWVlOzd6w7TENPqPVXbtz~gx-zIiL2ORwoQ4mGfFmF4i2x591tY7IOWxmVOCm1VytiSdgCaVfrsmnO9vNVXenqAUzDLKIqWWByik7ng-cqSr24LcPkp1chvEdTpIoZcEeQsHOVT90~wBdIPLGXczBkI7F2KUuAjBrQJEw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">¿Y el vestido azul?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">E o vestido azul?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/092382799dfc484ba09c7c6815fc95d8_l03b05-02-y-el-vestido-azul.mp3?Expires=1794099651&Signature=ARlEaZ9RGAfL086fKvaN5qi1RHkODHUQkGCA~nj5WIahVoUNTwevHMzLwfDL~tRjv28eCzczdT9ABWl5lBNv1zBj38xx9HRcPgWTQdtwBiqVfQONQwshhvMQWDSUrjKxrea~WWIvD~YGVH7t6iTOv8oJ8CpVjmhUm0-X~HC3JpSY1fVF-ppZKy6L9DqNfpHAUMvoq6eZZe11IgDWgjOLmPTmmM7KQ~QMzepafyteQoTCqfCB1ICYthQt6CKEbGRhBGyltZ4QerIxNRAna~i-Q3U018Shen5FOyLjAjWUohm014u5-w-dNH-QBJD--DAQlQznqR0cnRj1SxsfQpcHZg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">No creo que esta talla me deje moverme bien.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Não acho que este tamanho me deixe me mover bem.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/f9f62fedf97b412a91abb2122ab281b4_l03b03-02-no-creo-que-esta-talla-me-deje-moverme-bien.mp3?Expires=1794099651&Signature=SQT1b3NMJDXSC9qkH4YD~G6c3fNvn05sWReZGhVBegPJjctKvuhb1EEPCkKA7O43GQ8WFZQYHP4qKTu6O2XeCQfLiDD11IONMk74dRkqsNIya7DJPOgmXUVU34gKAiMsy9Jz~h~fH8GBzHPK49sejRIs8JgBgU3TgFOdcAmgWFsXTMX51ht4j4-b80STtJ6QlQj0IinxU9o~vVtp4vSDIkPgMKeJcao0WaEgi1AjSQd2jT2je8zHxjDh1QwlVWntxNZewNfrsbuvqVBLhZQ6H2pvcDGKLEJATzlL35QM9lYDjGrczTV7gxVuEXwyOEdBn7zyO5uOWRlymoK92I85gA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">En cuanto te traiga una talla más, los comparas otra vez.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Assim que eu te trouxer outro tamanho, você compara os dois de novo.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/d0ac142836264f4eb506fa79f4c917da_l03b05-03-en-cuanto-te-traiga-una-talla-mas-los-comparas-otra-vez.mp3?Expires=1794099651&Signature=sNmh8M08uJ9vdUg6c49SuMYu0~xEat-MOP47GBUIsOKnmnJEqYDKZMWG3Fz3-J5q9ni1vfu55Yi4kFuCBY~CND6TUo9TAZMJk~PzFOjOMjN-dSHtFBmBDfsy7XnlAuL5-FT8lT4uSDPCn~WhiPc8edDsN1oL7IlE4eE6s66djfgORfUWqFtJF1FEUMFAwtPsVc4kBaTJmvMRau7ivFoUOulrVixx89M1BhJLw1pZ2M3AvrJJekD2u~XEmmdvGGpOpnSFXPJxMOyeSOjd4YbgLGrbUcyc2Osk23-smi~MTX8sNM0MNeXRV-txQV8V8rwWtGs4ix7Cn0aH8xdVnr-tig__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
